WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.684 --> 00:00:11.544
On Sunday night, September 27, President Trump had a private dinner with Anthropic's CEO, Dario Amodei.

2
00:00:12.153 --> 00:00:14.984
The White House did not say what they discussed.

3
00:00:15.684 --> 00:00:24.084
Why does it stand out? Amodei is one of the industry's most outspoken voices on SI risks and safeguards.

4
00:00:24.084 --> 00:00:34.904
And the relationship had been tense. This year the Pentagon labeled Anthropic a supply chain risk, in a dispute over the company's limits on military use.

5
00:00:35.124 --> 00:00:37.784
Courts have since split over that label.

6
00:00:38.313 --> 00:00:42.244
The next evening, Semafor reported, Amodei was seen leaving a

7
00:00:42.244 --> 00:00:45.064
meeting with Senate Majority Leader John Thune.

8
00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:50.424
On Tuesday, he was at the table. And Anthropic signed the accord.

9
00:00:50.941 --> 00:00:57.464
What was said at dinner remains private. What is public is that the conversation is happening.
